<p>
Coos Bay, Oregon: my hometown and old stomping grounds, and Steve Prefontaine's too. I grew up here in the '90s and 2000s, a classic American childhood full of family and friends. The town keeps changing, and coming back now feels like running into an old friend I used to know.
</p>]]></content:encoded>
